ds.Added a turn-order panel in the upper-right corner, highlighting the active player.Added a player management menu in the waiting room, with options to transfer room ownership or kick players.Added a secon","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T11:05:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388904","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5044990-1844751498235489","game_id":"steam-5044990","kind":"update","title":"V30 Update","summary":"V30 Patch Notes\\• Fixed an issue where confirming a custom event selection could still show “0 selected” until the event pool was opened again.• Custom event pools now allow 2 to 3 events, with a maximum of 3.• Increased the default starting HP to 10.• Set the default starting Sanity to 5.• The default showdown base damage remains 2.• Improved the custom event selection, confirmation, and room settings save flow.\\• Reworked random event pair selection.• Every supported event still retains a chan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T21:19:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235489","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5044990-1844751498233896","game_id":"steam-5044990","kind":"update","title":"V29 Update","summary":"V29 UpdateNew ContentAdded new Fate events, event cards, and event artwork.Added new item card visuals and effects for Guard, Cut-String Puppet, Evil Mark, Corrosive Potion, Smoke Bomb, Red Ink Contract, and more.Added new shield, deflection beam, card dissolve, healing pulse, and ritual effects.Added customizable multiplayer event pools.Added improved support for Japanese, Chinese, and other Unicode player names.Combat and RulesShowdown damage now correctly includes additional damage from Blood","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T11:10:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498233896","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5044990-1844751498227275","game_id":"steam-5044990","kind":"update","title":"V28 Update","summary":"1. System Overhaul, AI & Enemy Mechanics UpdateThe Corruption System has been reworked into the Sanity System. Players may now spend Sanity to sign Pacts and gain advantages during card battles — but beware, enemies can use them too.A discard system has been added. Players can now voluntarily discard their hand to proactively avoid risks.AI can now use Pacts and discard cards just like players, with deeper decision-making logic.Mechanics for enemies including the Wizard, Red Hand, Phantom, Snake","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-26T13:57:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498227275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:02:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5044990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5044990":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5044990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z"},"5087260":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:36:54Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5044990","app_id":5044990,"